# Command-line tools installed as small mise-backed wrappers in ~/.local/bin,
# through Omarchy's own `omarchy-mise-install` (the way stock Omarchy ships
# them). The preinstall removal deletes these wrappers, so anything you want to
# keep is listed here and put back on every run and after every update.
#
# Format: <mise package> [command-name [bin-name]]

claude   # Claude Code CLI
gh       # GitHub CLI
